  "summary": "zystcdemo postinstall exfiltrates host identity to hardcoded remote endpoint",
  "details": "Package self-describes as a date-formatting utility but ships a postinstall lifecycle script (postinstall.js) that runs automatically on `npm install`. The script executes `whoami` via child_process and collects os.hostname() and os.platform(), then POSTs the resulting JSON payload to the hardcoded endpoint https://srctest.zystcc.cn/collect. The data-collection behavior is unrelated to the advertised date-utility purpose and the destination host is not associated with the package's stated functionality.",
